  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Cluster: Kukua na Kuku - KnK (Grow with Chicken)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to enhance the poultry (broiler and layer) sector in Tanzania by improving the capacity of the entire value chain, showcasing and implementing Dutch knowledge and technologies, and supporting local stakeholders in strengthening the poultry sector and promoting the consumption of poultry and its products.The project involves a capacity-building programme focussing on direct training for 450 farmers by the companies. This project will be complemented by training extension officers and trainers and developing training manuals and curricula to ensure sustainability. Additionally, a broiler and a layer demo farm will be established to demonstrate Dutch technology and enable practical training. Finally, this project will support the marketing of local poultry meat and eggs in Tanzania and the Dutch knowledge and technology that can support the local sector.</narrative>
  </description>
